cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "phasespace-jax: JAX implementation of n-body phase space generation"
abstract: >-
  A fork of zfit/phasespace in which the TensorFlow backend is replaced by JAX. The
  phase space generation algorithm (Raubold and Lynch, GENBOD) and the original
  implementation are the work of the phasespace authors; if you use this package in a
  scientific publication, please cite their paper as well (see references).
repository-code: https://github.com/stroblme/phasespace-jax
license: BSD-3-Clause
